Roadmap. Say it with me. Roadmap!

8
00:00:41.243 --> 00:00:44.969
Priority. Say it with me. Priority!

9
00:00:48.425 --> 00:00:51.825
Feature. Say it with me. Feature!

10
00:00:55.301 --> 00:00:59.120
Feedback. Say it with me. Feedback!

11
00:01:02.661 --> 00:01:06.694
Metrics. Say it with me. Metrics!

12
00:01:10.206 --> 00:01:13.590
