13
00:01:17.106 --> 00:01:27.770
Product managers focus on user needs. They build a roadmap, set each priority, and decide which feature comes first. Feedback and metrics guide the team.

14
00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:31.422
Now I understand. Thank you, Mr. Daniel!

15
00:01:32.252 --> 00:01:37.251
