16
00:01:37.301 --> 00:01:38.451
Roadmap!

17
00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:44.847
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:44.897 --> 00:01:46.047
Metrics!

19
00:01:47.083 --> 00:01:53.856
Did you know? Product managers often say 'no' to good ideas so the team can focus on the most important ones!

20
00:01:53.906 --> 00:01:56.105
Wow! I did not know that!

21
